    timing_push.sh) is journaled at push; the run header bundle_sha256 must equal that push's journaled TRANSPORT sha, and the
    header agent_yaml_sha256 must equal the sha256 of agent.yaml inside the registered zip, identical in every smoke/main/chunk header.
  Any mismatch = (iii) fails (smoke) or the run is not counted (main/chunk); report, no rule.
