|---|---|
| CPU x86 VM for gold calibration and Phase-2 checks | $5 |
| E4B on 1×L4 (spot) | $30 |
| 31B on 4×L4 (spot) | $65 |
| LoRA training (no A100 on GCP for now; see decision 003) | TBD |
| Reserve | $20 |

